{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t石鼓洲焚化爐發生三級火，無人受傷。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n警方在下午近1時接獲職員報案， 發生火警。消防到場，約於1時半將火警升為三級，並派出4輛救護車在場戒備。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T06:20:37.294752+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":77,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T06:09:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T06:18:14.494639+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T06:18:14.494639+00:00","content_hash":"08c7c2639699ccc08e082664abc7732560802ecad3f936d83ff3b716c67e9cfa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}